  "solution": {
    "text": "Drawing force diagrams of the rod, we have<br /><br />This is the equilibrium of coplanar forces, hence using the equations<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8721;</mo> <msub> <mtext>F</mtext> <mi>x</mi> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mn>0</mn> <mtext>,</mtext> <mo>&#8721;</mo> <msub> <mtext>F</mtext> <mi>y</mi> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;and<br />&nbsp;<br />Net moment about point O = 0<br /><br /><br /><br /><u><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0103_39219e09c9cb.jpg\" style=\"width: 353px; height: 391px;\" /></strong></u><br /><br /><br />we have the equations,<br />&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>+</mo></math><math><mrow><mfrac linethickness=\"1\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></math>... (i)<br />&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi></math>&nbsp; ...(ii)<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>+</mo></math><math><mrow><mfrac linethickness=\"1\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ... (iii)<br />&nbsp;<br />and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi></math><math><mrow><mfrac linethickness=\"1\"><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; ... (iv)<br /><br />Solving these four equations, we have<br />&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8289;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">M</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">m</mtext></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">g</mtext><mtext>cot</mtext><mi>&#952;</mi></math>"
  }
